    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-08-30T21:17:58+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-30T21:17:58+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-30T11:47:58Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-30T11:47:58Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A high pressure system southeast of SA continues extending a ridge across the state, as it moves over Victoria overnight and into the Tasman Sea by late Monday. A cold front is then forecast to move across the state on Tuesday, as another ridge and high push in behind the front on Wednesday. Another cold front may slip across the southeast parts of SA early Thursday, with the high moving over eastern SA.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW014" description="North East Pastoral" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-08-30T21:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-31T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-30T11:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-30T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Clear. Winds southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-08-31T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-01T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-30T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-31T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny. The chance of morning fog south of Yunta. The chance of morning frost south of Yunta. Winds southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h tending northeast to southeasterly in the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 5 and 12 with daytime temperatures reaching 21 to 29.</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:20am to 3:10pm, UV Index predicted to reach 7 [High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-09-01T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-02T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-31T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-01T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Slight chance of a shower south of Yunta in the evening. Near zero chance of rain elsewhere. Winds northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending north to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h in the early morning then tending north to northwesterly 25 to 35 km/h in the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 7 and 13 with daytime temperatures reaching 25 to 32.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-09-02T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-03T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-01T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-02T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Slight chance of a shower south of Yunta, near zero chance elsewhere. Winds north to northwesterly 25 to 35 km/h tending northwest to southwesterly during the day then tending southeast to southwesterly 15 to 20 km/h during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 11 and 16 with daytime temperatures reaching 23 to 34.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-09-03T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-04T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-02T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-03T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Winds southeast to southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h tending northeast to southeasterly during the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 7 and 16 with daytime temperatures reaching 21 to 34.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
